  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040120,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……！\r\nやったーっ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "喜んでもらえて、スゴくうれしいですっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、本当に美味しいよ\r\nでも、こんなにもらっちゃって良かったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい、もちろんですっ。今日のクッキーは\r\nプロデューサーさんに渡したかったんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、うれしいよ\r\n家庭科の時間に作ったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　……クッキーを焼いてる間\r\n学校のみんなと誰に渡すのかって話で盛り上がりました",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "みんなは、大切な人に渡す……って、言ってました",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それならあたしが渡す人はプロデューサーさんだって\r\n──そう思ったんです！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂……\r\nそんなこと考えてくれたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。プロデューサーさんのおかげで\r\nあたしは色んなアイドルのお仕事ができて……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "毎日スッゴく楽しいんですっ！\r\nだから、あたしの１番大切な人はプロデューサーさんですっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ありがとう。全部大事に食べさせてもらうよ\r\n果穂の想いがこもったクッキーだからな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どれどれ……うん、疲れた身体に染みわたる甘さだ\r\n何枚でも食べられそうだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "本当ですか！？\r\nえへへ、良かったです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。ほら、果穂も一緒に食べよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ……\r\nはむっ……あれ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうかしたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "学校で焼きたてを味見したんですけど……\r\nなんだか……ちょっとちがう感じがします",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは多分……焼きたてと今とで\r\n食感が違うんだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうなんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。冷めてサクサク感が増したんじゃないかな\r\n甘さだけじゃなくて、歯応えもあってうまいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040240,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！\r\nそれなら良かったですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040250,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、学校で食べた焼きたてでほくほくなクッキーも\r\nスゴく美味しかったんです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040260,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だからあたし……いつか焼きたても\r\nプロデューサーさんに食べてもらいたいですっ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そっか\r\n話を聞いてたら、焼きたても食べたくなってきたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040270,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　あたし、頑張って作りますっ！\r\nだから楽しみに待っててくださいっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040270"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040280,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わかりますか！？　色んな味のクッキーが作りたくて\r\nチョコやナッツを入れたんです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\nうん、それぞれに違う美味しさがあっていいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040290,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "同じ生地でも色んな味にできるから\r\n作ってて面白かったです",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040300,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "お菓子って……食べるだけじゃなくて\r\n作るのも楽しいんですねっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、果穂はすっかりお菓子作りに\r\nはまったみたいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040310,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい、また作りたいなって思いましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040320,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "──そうだ！\r\nプロデューサーさんも、今度一緒に作りませんか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040330,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　一緒に作ったら絶対楽しいですっ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900404/2009004040330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……やってみるか！\r\nはづきさんに言えば、事務所の台所が使えるだろうし",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004040340,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わあっ……ありがとうございます！\r\nじゃあ事務所で一緒に作りましょう！　約束ですっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
